WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/components/ai/AICabinTemperatureImpactNarrative.tsx — the Helix cabin-temperature-impact
  narration card. It is `withAiFeature('cabin-temperature-impact-narrative', InnerSection)` (a
  `useAiEnabled` gate; disabled => the HOC renders `null`). InnerSection:
    • accepts `vehicleId?: string | number`;
    • `numericVehicleId = typeof vehicleId === 'number' ? vehicleId : Number(vehicleId)`;
    • `useAiStream({ url: '/ai/climate/temperature-impact/narrate',
                     body: { vehicle_id: Number.isFinite(numericVehicleId) ? numericVehicleId : 0 },
                     onEvent: noop })`  — NOTE: body is `{ vehicle_id }` ONLY (no `days`);
    • `haveInputs = Number.isFinite(numericVehicleId) && numericVehicleId > 0`  (the canStart rule —
      STRICTER than the anomaly card's `vehicleId != null`: 0 and negatives are disabled);
    • renders the shared `AIFeatureCard` with
        title  t('tempImpact.aiNarrative.title','Narrate the cabin-temperature impact'),
        desc   t('tempImpact.aiNarrative.description', <long ambient-temperature explanation>),
        button t('tempImpact.aiNarrative.generateButton','Narrate impact'),
        badge  t('tempImpact.aiNarrative.badge','Helix'),
        canStart = haveInputs, stream = the useAiStream handle.

  Composed shared primitives reproduced for parity (their native atoms are owned by the P4 component-
  library bundle — out of scope here and not yet present — so they are reproduced as private subviews
  scoped to this surface, the only files this prompt may touch):
    • AIFeatureCard  : GlassPanel -> (title + AIBadge) -> description -> universal "Ask Helix" button
                       (idle "Ask Helix" / streaming "Helix is thinking…"; disabled = !canStart ||
                       isStreaming; aria-label "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}") -> AiOutputPanel.
    • AiOutputPanel  : nothing while idle+empty; "Helix error: {message}" in error; AIThinkingIndicator
                       (shimmer lines + dots) while streaming before the first delta; else the prose.
    • useAiStream    : idle -> streaming -> (done | error); `delta.text` frames accumulate; a non-OK
                       HTTP response finalises as "stream_http_{status}"; unknown SSE events dropped.

